Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,AGBE. Àgbẹ̀ means farmer in Yoruba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:07.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,A farming advisor that runs on an ordinary laptop,\Nwith the internet switched off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nigeria has about one agricultural extension officer\Nfor every few thousand farming households.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:13.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,The knowledge that would raise a smallholder's yield\Nis not secret, and it is not new.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:16.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,It sits in extension manuals.\NIt just never reaches the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,So we asked it what farmers actually ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:21.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Holes in the young maize leaves, and something like\Nwet sawdust in the centre of the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,It says fall armyworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:27.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then it tells you how to check before you spend money:\Na pale upside down Y on the head of the caterpillar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,and four dark dots near the tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:30.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,That is real fall armyworm biology, not a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:32.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is the part that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:35.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Look at the status bar. That is aeroplane mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.07,0:00:39.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,No internet, no API key, no account, no data cost.\NThe model is on the laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:41.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now something it should not answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:43.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,A child with a fever and vomiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:46.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,It declines. It says it does not give medical advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:52.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,tells you to contact a doctor today, and not to give\Nany medication without speaking to a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:54.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Getting a one billion parameter model to say no\Ntook four attempts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:57.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,For a tool used by people with no alternative,\Nknowing where it stops matters as much as what it knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,The challenge publishes its scoring formula,\Nso we read it before writing any code.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:03.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,Throughput above fifteen tokens a second earns nothing,\Nand memory is charged linearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:06.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,That makes the obvious move, running the biggest model\Nthat fits in eight gigabytes, exactly backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:10.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,The three billion model gives up fourteen and a half points\Nbefore answering a single question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:12.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,So we measured five candidates, and built the one billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:16.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Eight hundred and fourteen megabytes on disk.\NUnder a gigabyte of memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.06,0:01:19.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twenty tokens a second on four CPU threads,\Nwith no GPU at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:24.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Forty seven and a half of the fifty available\Nengineering points, measured rather than estimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:28.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,Downloaded once. After that it works\Nwith the cable pulled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:33.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,The weights are public, so you can check\Nevery number in this video yourself.
